  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/01/IMG_0775.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(10 fotos) La tarde de este jueves ha reabierto sus puertas el bar El Xicotet de la Font de Dins, con nueva y joven gerencia, en la plaza del Almud&iacute;n de Onda. En su amplia terraza o en la barra se puede tomar refrescos, cerveza, caf&eacute;. c&oacute;cteles, batidos, tapas, bocadillos, &#39;torraetes&#39;, desayunos y meriendas, adem&aacute;s de cerveza y montadito por dos euros.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reaperturaxicotetfontdedins/img_0757.jpg\" alt=\"img_0757\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reaperturaxicotetfontdedins/img_0758.jpg\" alt=\"img_0758\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reaperturaxicotetfontdedins/img_0761.jpg\" alt=\"img_0761\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reaperturaxicotetfontdedins/img_0763.jpg\" alt=\"img_0763\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reaperturaxicotetfontdedins/img_0767.jpg\" alt=\"img_0767\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reaperturaxicotetfontdedins/img_0769.jpg\" alt=\"img_0769\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reaperturaxicotetfontdedins/img_0770.jpg\" alt=\"img_0770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reaperturaxicotetfontdedins/img_0771.jpg\" alt=\"img_0771\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d471543